# Normalize line endings to LF on every platform.
#
# The CSP in index.html whitelists its inline JSON-LD blocks by sha256 of their
# exact bytes. With core.autocrlf=true and no rule here, a Windows checkout
# rewrites index.html to CRLF — changing those bytes and silently invalidating
# the hashes (the CSP then blocks its own structured data). test/csp.test.js
# guards against the same drift, but this file makes the bytes identical
# everywhere: dev machines, CI, and the GitHub Pages artifact.
* text=auto eol=lf
